Hey, I thought of something though it is pretty remote ...

I'm assuming that you do not have a potion of holy water or an altar
available to you because if so you could just find a potion, dilute
it, bless it and go crazy with the drawbridge.  So, one slim
possibility is to kill a monster and eventually find a scroll of
teleportation. Then find a fountain and dip a potion in it until you
have unholy water; you'll need identification, multiple potions or a
pet to be able to tell whether the potion turns cursed but once cursed
you can use it on a scroll of teleportation and uncontrolled levelport
(hopefully) above Medusa's level.

Another possibly more likely option is to kill enough monsters and
acquire a useful wand.

